>!! A stray angle bracket answers the same way it answers in wikitext
#^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext markup.heading.2.tiddlywiki5 meta.heading.heading-2.tiddlywiki5 punctuation.definition.heading.tiddlywiki5 markup.heading.punctuation.definition.tiddlywiki5
